# Hard functional-analysis statements from Conway

Ten statement-only formalizations selected from John B. Conway,
*A Course in Functional Analysis*, second edition.

Each problem lives in `Dataset/ConwayFunctionalAnalysis/<declaration_name>.lean`,
accompanied by `<declaration_name>.md` (the natural-language statement from
the textbook) and `<declaration_name>.criteria.md` (a quality rubric for
judging formalizations of that statement).
Custom notions shared between problems are in `Dataset/ConwayFunctionalAnalysis/Defs.lean`.
-/
